{
  "_comment": [
    "Deployment config. Run: tvc deploy create tvc-deploy.json",
    "Then approve: tvc deploy approve --deploy-id <UUID> --operator-id <UUID>",
    "",
    "pivotPath / pivotArgs: what TVC boots inside the enclave.",
    "expectedPivotDigest: sha256 of /usr/local/bin/node in the image.",
    "  Compute with: scripts/build-and-digest.sh <image-url>",
    "",
    "The image @sha256 pin is the primary code-integrity guarantee —",
    "the container image digest commits to proxy.cjs (and therefore all",
    "application logic). The pivot digest additionally pins the Node version.",
    "",
    "Environment variables are baked into the container image for vault mode.",
    "ADMIN_TOKEN and ANTHROPIC_API_KEY should be passed via a private registry",
    "image that is not publicly accessible (use pivotContainerEncryptedPullSecret)."
  ],
  "appId": "<app-UUID-from-tvc-app-create>",
  "pivotContainerImageUrl": "your-registry/nanoclaw-tvc-proxy:latest@sha256:<image-digest>",
  "pivotPath": "/usr/local/bin/node",
  "pivotArgs": "/app/proxy.cjs",
  "expectedPivotDigest": "<sha256-of-node-binary-from-build-and-digest-sh>",
  "pivotContainerEncryptedPullSecret": null,
  "publicIngressPort": 443,
  "healthCheckPort": 3000,
  "healthCheckType": "TVC_HEALTH_CHECK_TYPE_HTTP"
}
